# 16. Quick Revision

```dart
Row(
  children: [
    Widget1(),
    Widget2(),
  ],
)
```

means:

```text
Widget1   Widget2
```

While:

```dart
Column(
  children: [
    Widget1(),
    Widget2(),
  ],
)
```

means:

```text
Widget1
Widget2
```

### One-line definitions

> **Row** arranges multiple widgets horizontally.

> **Column** arranges multiple widgets vertically.
